# MediBot — Phase-Wise Implementation Plan
### Personalized Primary-Care AI Assistant · Version 2.0

> **Document basis:** MediBot Final Product, Technical Architecture & Execution Specification (v2.0) combined with all provided UML, sequence, flow, and architecture diagrams.

---

## Executive Context

MediBot is a **longitudinal, personalized health assistant** that maintains a structured **Patient 360** — containing medical history, diagnoses, allergies, medications, lab results, uploaded documents, wearable-derived trends, lifestyle signals, and clinically meaningful encounters — and uses a **fine-tuned Medical LLM** as a controlled reasoning/communication component inside a larger deterministic safety architecture.

### Core Product Loop
```
Capture health info → Structure it → Preserve provenance → Retrieve only relevant context
→ Run deterministic safety checks → Medical LLM reasons/explains/selects tools
→ Validate response → Show sources + escalate when required
```

### Architecture Layers (from diagrams)
| Layer | Components |
|---|---|
| **Client Layer** | Web App, Mobile App |
| **API & Security Layer** | API Gateway, Authentication, Consent Management |
| **MediBot Core Layer** | Orchestrator, Safety Engine, Context Engine, Tool Gateway |
| **AI Reasoning Layer** | Model Router, Fine-tuned Medical LLM, Structured Output Adapter |
| **Validation & Oversight Layer** | Response Safety Validator, Escalation Service, Human/Clinical Review |
| **Patient Data & Knowledge Layer** | Wearable Data, Conversation History, Medical Knowledge/RAG, Patient Health Record, Medical Documents, Drug Knowledge |

